DemoteToExitOnly_PoolRegistry_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when caller neither guardian nor owner
│  └── it should revert with UnauthorizedCaller
└── when caller authorized
   ├── given pool unknown
   │  └── it should revert with PoolNotActive
   ├── given pool exit only
   │  └── it should revert with PoolNotActive
   ├── given pool active and idle only
   │  ├── it should set the status to exit only
   │  └── it should not change the active pool count
   └── given pool active
      ├── when caller guardian
      │  ├── it should set the status to exit only
      │  ├── it should decrement the active pool count
      │  ├── it should keep the pool in the roster
      │  ├── it should increment the epoch
      │  └── it should emit PoolDemoted
      └── when caller owner
         └── it should set the status to exit only
